{"n":24,"title":"Filling in the form","blurb":"Asking for clarification, and a model completed form","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Match each situation to the reason you could not follow it.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"too much noise"},{"label":"too fast"},{"label":"bad signal"},{"label":"a new word"},{"label":"too much noise"},{"label":"too fast"},{"label":"bad signal"},{"label":"a new word"},{"label":"too much noise"},{"label":"too fast"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"surname","pos":"n","ru":"фамилия","kk":"тегі","def":"your family name, which you write after your first name","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-surname.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/81854c977131.mp3"},{"en":"date of birth","pos":"n","ru":"дата рождения","kk":"туған күні","def":"the day, month and year when you were born","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-date-of-birth.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/6083ea53d130.mp3"},{"en":"marital status","pos":"n","ru":"семейное положение","kk":"отбасылық жағдайы","def":"whether you are single, married, divorced or widowed","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-marital-status.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/e1c3f71b85f8.mp3"},{"en":"occupation","pos":"n","ru":"род занятий, профессия","kk":"мамандығы","def":"your job or profession","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-occupation.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/75afa872370d.mp3"},{"en":"signature","pos":"n","ru":"подпись","kk":"қолтаңба","def":"your name written by you in your own way, to show a document is yours","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-signature.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/fab5f62863cd.mp3"},{"en":"block capitals","pos":"n","ru":"печатные заглавные буквы","kk":"бас әріптермен","def":"large letters like A, B, C, used so that writing is easy to read","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-block-capitals.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/f8f1f0f8d149.mp3"},{"en":"tick","pos":"v","ru":"ставить галочку","kk":"белгі қою","def":"to put a small mark in a box to show that you have chosen it","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-tick.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/383216819013.mp3"},{"en":"next of kin","pos":"n","ru":"ближайший родственник","kk":"жақын туысы","def":"your closest relative, who should be contacted if something happens to you","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-next-of-kin.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/8df8d3f83afc.mp3"},{"en":"enrol","pos":"v","ru":"записаться (на курс)","kk":"тіркелу","def":"to put your name officially on the list of a course or a school","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-enrol.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/95e1c2eca888.mp3"},{"en":"apply","pos":"v","ru":"подавать заявление","kk":"өтініш беру","def":"to ask formally, usually in writing, for a job, a place or a document","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-apply.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/69f45da1683c.mp3"},{"en":"register","pos":"v","ru":"регистрироваться","kk":"тіркелу","def":"to put your name on an official list","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-register.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/13a2828b3ade.mp3"},{"en":"explain","pos":"v","ru":"объяснять","kk":"түсіндіру","def":"to make something clear by giving more information about it","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-explain.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/f7c1380a0d71.mp3"},{"en":"mistake","pos":"n","ru":"ошибка","kk":"қате","def":"something you do or write that is wrong","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-mistake.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/c07a45a81c6a.mp3"},{"en":"signal","pos":"n","ru":"сигнал, связь","kk":"сигнал","def":"the radio waves that carry a phone call or an internet connection","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-signal.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/36ab4aaa56c8.mp3"},{"en":"search engine","pos":"n","ru":"поисковая система","kk":"іздеу жүйесі","def":"a program such as Google that finds information on the internet","img":"/course/a2/img/l24-search-engine.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/c482a0634163.mp3"},{"en":"promotion","pos":"n","ru":"повышение (по службе)","kk":